# The voxel island at sunset under the physically based sky: the sun's
# light crosses so much air near the horizon that it loses its blue and
# turns orange, and the shadows grow long.

image_width  800
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 128
max_depth    16

camera lookfrom 80 35 80  lookat 0 10 0  vfov 50
tonemap aces

sun elevation 6 azimuth 200 intensity 4 angle 3
sky atmosphere
material ground lambertian 0.3 0.3 0.3
ground ground

vox models/island.vox
